    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "It is with great pleasure we offer this stunning 2 bedroom apartment to the market - excellently & centrally located in the development of An Altan on the Western Distributor Road. This super property is sure to appeal to the discerning buyer seeking a quality residence combined with good location.\n\nNo 8 Altan is on the 3rd floor and is presented in show house condition with bright and spacious accommodation.\n\nAccommodation is offered as follows: entrance foyer, open plan kitchen, dining and living area with access to private full length balcony, offering elevated great views of the surrounding area. \nThe living space is exceptionally bright and airy given its aspect and one could purchase this residence and happily move in immediately. There are two double bedrooms - both with built in wardrobes and the master comes with fully tiled en suite. The main bathroom is also tiled floor to ceiling and comes with bath and mixer tap shower. \nThe style and layout is contemporary and stylish - well finished and spacious and is ideally suited to modern living.\n\nAltan, which is predominantly owner occupied, was constructed c. 2005. The grounds, lift and shared communal areas are kept in excellent condition by the Direct Property maintenance company. Ample parking is available. \n\nIt is conveniently located within walking distance of Knocknacarra Retail Park, Sheridan`s Bar and Restaurant, The Clybaun Hotel, a host of Primary & Secondary schools and surrounding sports and recreational facilities. Located on an excellent road, bus & transport network with easy access to Dunnes, Aldi, NUIG & UCHG. \n\nACCOMMODATION\nEntrance Hallway 1.153x3.165 \nSemi solid timber flooring, ceiling coving and centre rose. Hot press with built in shelving.\n\nKitchen 2.01x2.7\nTiled floor and tiled splashback, cooker, oven hob and extractor fan. High quality kitchen with washing machine, dryer and integrated fridge freezer.\n\nLounge 4.5x3.46\nSemi solid timber flooring with electric storage heaters, coving centre rose and feature fireplace. Double glazed doors to balcony.\n\nMain bathroom 2.114x1.96 \nHigh standard finish with tiled floors, fully tiled walls, cast iron bath with mixer tap shower. \n\nBedroom 4.29x2.71\nSemi solid timber floors, coving, fitted wardrobes and en suite.\n\nEn suite 1.75x1.75\nTiled floor to ceiling, WHB, WC and large shower cubicle, \n\nBedroom 2.18x2.71\nLarge double bedroom with semi solid timber floors, PVC double glazed windows, built in wardrobes and ceiling coving.\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Notice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Superb 3rd floor, spacious 2 bedroom apartment in turn key condition </li><li> Exceptionally well located on the Western Distributor Road in Knocknacarra </li><li> Bright, well planned ,open style kitchen, lounge & dining area </li><li> Both bedrooms are double in size & with built in wardrobes </li><li> Main bedroom is with fully tiled en suite </li><li> Rear of property looks onto lovely green spaces & is very quiet </li><li> Secure underground parking available as well as external ground floor parking </li><li> Great value for 1st time buyer </li><li> Viewing is highly recommended</li></ul>"
      },
